    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "This deployment automation demonstrates production-grade patterns: health checking, gradual traffic shifting (canary deployment), automatic rollback on failure, and integration with monitoring systems. Such automation transforms risky manual deployments into reliable, repeatable processes."
    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
